# Git only infers "binary" from a NUL byte in a blob's first 8000 bytes, and the
# small reportlab-generated fixture PDFs contain none. Without this, a clone made
# with core.autocrlf=true (the Git for Windows installer default) expands every
# LF in them to CRLF on checkout, shifting the xref offsets so the file no longer
# opens ("Unexpected EOF"). See issue #9.
*.pdf binary
